  "system": {
    "biography": "<p>Lone Star officers. <strong>Four hold the Pacific Towers lobby</strong> (QE p.14), and more arrive if a Strice Matrix alert Traces the decker or a scene goes loud.</p><p><strong>Gear is printed</strong> (p.14): Browning Max-Power heavy pistols, stun batons, Armor Vests. <strong>Attributes are not</strong> — the adventure defers to the SR1 Street Cop contact, so these come from SR2's own <em>Corporate Security Guard</em> archetype (core p.205), which happens to be identical to the Pacific Towers guard block on p.15.</p><p>The stun baton's printed <em>\"+ Special\"</em> is a stun effect beyond the damage code — GM adjudicates.</p><p><em>The old actor carried an Ares Predator and no baton or vest.</em></p>",
